11284538,2024-12-27,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX pa XXXX EXETER FINANCE LLC XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX TX XXXX XX/XX/XXXX Dear EXETER FINANCE LLC I am writing to formally dispute the reporting of the charge-off account associated with Account Number ( XXXX on my credit report. 
