XXXX. Authenticated Evidence Based on [ State Name ] Law In addition to accounting records, I require authenticated evidence, in compliance with the [ State Consumer Debt Collection Law/Act, include citation if available ], that you have the legal right to report and collect this debt. This includes original signed contracts or agreements that show my obligation to pay the debt and your legal right to enforce collection and report it to credit bureaus. 
Without this evidence, the continued reporting of this debt may constitute a violation of both federal and state consumer protection laws. XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX XXXX ( XXXX. XXXX XXXX. XXXX ) requires that creditors produce original signed documentation to prove the validity of a debt Permissible Purpose and Reporting Status Verification I am requesting verification of your permissible purpose for reporting this account, as well as clarification of the current reporting status. Under the FCRA, furnishers must have a valid and permissible purpose to report accounts, especially if the status of the account has changed. 

