11286546,2024-12-27,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"I am writing to formally request the deletion of an unverifiable account from my credit report under the provisions of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), 15 U.S.C. 1681 et seq. Specifically, this pertains to the account identified as a {$380.00} charge-off with XXXX XXXX XXXX. 
