11295573,2024-12-27,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"XXXX XXXX XXXX, Apt XXXX XXXX, Texas XXXX XXXX Phone : XXXX [ XX/XX/year> ] Equifax Information Services LLC XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, GA XXXX Subject : Notification of Violation of Section 611 ( b ) of the Fair Credit Reporting Act Dear Sir or Madam : I am writing to you regarding a potential violation of Section 611 ( b ) of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). Under this provision, if an item previously deleted from my credit report is reinserted, I must be notified in writing within five business days of the reinsertion. 

